4. What is a Flowchart + Standard Symbols

A *flowchart* is a diagram that shows the flow of an algorithm using shapes and arrows.
Symbol	Name	Use
!	Terminal	Start or end of the algorithm
!	Input/Output	Get input or display output
!	Process	Perform a calculation or action
!	Decision	Make a yes/no or true/false decision
!	Flow line	Show direction of flow
[Oval][Parallelogram][Rectangle][Diamond][Arrow]
You connect these shapes with arrows to show the order of steps.
